{% extends 'noBarBase.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Ultimate Warfare - The Story{% endblock title %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-header">Ultimate Warfare - The Story</div>
        <div class="uw-card-body text-center">
            <p>
                The year was 1945. The earth was in a mess. The two main superpowers, America and Russia, had engaged in an massive war.
                Though both knew that the war was only a cover up. America and Russia had both finally finished creating the ultimate weapon.
                It was known as the 'Syphon Warhead'.
            </p>

            <p>
                <img src="{{ asset('images/story1.jpg') }}" width="400" height="300" alt="Syphon Warhead!" style="border-radius: 6px;" />
            </p>

            <p>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ path('Game/Story/Chapter1', {'page': 2}) }}"><strong>Next &raquo;</strong></a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
